  "K_over_xi_rs": "1",
  "reading": "Under the adopted reading (MTW sign, covariant box, R = 8 pi G rho/c^2 at weak field) the exterior solution is sigma = 2 xi GM/(r c^2) = xi r_s/r; sigma_from_potential codes xi GM/(r c^2), a factor 2 apart. audit.py:145 says sigma_from_potential is 'Direct from box sigma = -xi R'. Which side is wrong is decision C2 (Captain's).",
  "tag": "[DERIVED] under the adopted reading (design section 2.1)"
 },
